 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Generally, yes. A good camera is worth paying for, even in a budget laptop. Then a cheap camera in your phone is probably good enough. It's when you start doing video calls all day that a better camera matters. If you only need it for calls, it' a bit of a hassle to set up and remember to plug in. Stick with the camera in your phone. Then a little table top webcam like the Logitech C920 is pretty good. It' what most people who aren't in photography use.",
